+  $$ \mathbf{W}_i = \mathbf{Q}_{1i} \cdot \mathbf{Q}_{2i} $$
+  where $\mathbf{Q}_{1i} \in \mathbb{R}^{1 \times n_1 \times r}$ and $\mathbf{Q}_{2i} \in \mathbb{R}^{r \times n_2 \times 1}$ [S1, unofficial].
